  <item>
    <title>学海无涯苦打工，学历越高越发疯</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658569f2157cd445eeb366c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658569f2157cd445eeb366c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Dec 2023 10:50:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近关于年轻人劳动价值被低估的话题不断。“东方甄选”的风波里，头部主播董宇辉和无名的文案小编都被视作年轻人的才能与贡献没有得到匹配回报的例证；企业家董明珠提出员工跳槽去更高薪岗位要给原企业交培训费，以此来约束年轻人；更有戏谑高学历毕业生求职的段子，“要求硕士以上学历，三年工作经验，25岁以下”，“陆本海硕，奈雪家人”等等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天三位主播分别以北大状元、京大博士及前复旦博士后、全美前十商学院毕业生的经历来来聊聊学历贬值。祝大家圣诞新年，平安快乐有钱！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjK82cAwoqTI9rgZPMTJquN5iHNx.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">00:01:22</a> 年轻人价值被低估：围绕东方甄选董宇辉与格力董明珠的争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">00:02:26</a> 上海万圣节盛况，只是弱者的自嘲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">00:04:54</a> 学历已死？沈念聊青年学者的困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="607">00:10:07</a> 学术界金字塔结构，在各行各业都有类似模型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">00:12:00</a> 制霸高考系统的小吴如何填报志愿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">00:15:40</a> 父母掌握的信息资源对于求学至关重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">00:20:30</a> 杨眉的高中记忆：我在刷题冲顶校，顶校毕业生应聘不上我的老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">00:22:30</a> 高考系统里的做题隔离了职业应用场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">00:24:35</a> 热血青春的考试叙事失效了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">00:29:15</a> 升学题材国剧里主角是父母，刷题的孩子主体性不显著</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1913">00:31:53</a> 真正的学习从大学开始，社交的重要性也同时凸显</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">00:35:10</a> 招聘从来不只靠学历，还有隐性的信号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2517">00:41:57</a> 高考状元的被异化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2627">00:43:47</a> 小吴聊大学的“通关地图”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">00:47:08</a> “原生职场”；相亲平台上标签化的人与学历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">00:49:30</a> 小吴裸辞的理由：我们不一定要回去上班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3294">00:54:54</a> 小吴对妈妈的“再教育”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3434">00:57:14</a> 文化产业对年轻人的贬低：拖欠稿费、不签合同的机构们，做个人吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">01:03:00</a> 年轻人的反击，自媒体的崛起：给自己打工！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4060">01:07:40</a> 大机构人员的跋扈，背后可能是失权的恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖相关书籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>《学历之死：美国博士消亡史》</span></p><span></span><p><span>“Pedigree: How Elite Students Get Elite Jobs”</span></p><span></span><p><span>（《出身：不平等的选拔与精英的自我复制》）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《金榜题名之后：大学生出路分化之谜》</span></p><span></span><p><span>📺相关影视</span></p><span></span><p><span>《葬送的芙莉莲》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《龙樱》、《龙樱2》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《垫底辣妹》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《天空之城》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小舍得》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《少年派》</span></p><span></span><p><span>💌欢迎互动</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入听友微信群：Ultrawomen2023</span></p><span></span><p><span>询洽合作：meiy.25@hotmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrCX9fsNk6pkgI-0j_fgD10gj3IZ.m4a" length="140267579" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsycFHJiBVppldtZaDOIw92F7BvW.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>骂我可以，但不能说我像爸妈！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6578148f6396a4645a95d771</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6578148f6396a4645a95d771</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Dec 2023 08:06:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>童年的我们，可能对父母有过依赖、崇拜或深情。然而，从何时起呢，父母身上的某些特质成了我们最想摆脱的污点。“我想成为像父母那样的人”的叙事逐渐淡出，“不许说我像爸妈”成了新的抵抗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲子之“爱”，成为了私欲交缠的遮掩，索要的是惨烈的牺牲，渗透的是病态的控制。</span></p><span></span><p><span>原生家庭之痛在面对如此沉重的“爱”时，又该从何启齿？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“父母为你付出这么多，你却连这点小事都要计较吗？”“父母对你做的一切都是为你好呀！父母是不会害你的！”“你怎么不记得父母的好，只记得父母的坏。”“父母已经老了，你要让让父母。”“父母终归是父母。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一次沟通的尝试，都被扼杀在听过千万次的回声之中。“家”，逐渐成了孩子无法存在、无法呼吸的空间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>爸爸妈妈呀，我们是否还能再爱你们一次？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpPT6LO_C6NWut68YIUm8OEcxb25.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:00:23</a> “你真像你爸/你妈”或成侮辱性极强的攻击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">00:02:18</a> 亲子之间沟通欲低落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">00:03:40</a> 愚孝（PUA大法）失效，父母面对代际差异十分错愕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">00:06:38</a> 传统上下级式的亲子关系巩固了“媳妇熬成婆”的模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">00:09:15</a> 年轻人理解父母的悲剧，父母却不能共情年轻人的苦痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">00:14:00</a> 父母意识不到自己经历的时代红利，也不理解年轻人正在面对的困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">00:19:45</a> 父母的经济支援有时会成为要挟的筹码，两代人之间的捆绑与冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">00:22:13</a> 张爱玲也曾因为父母吝于支援而怀怨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">00:27:35</a> 从小家庭到大环境都在贬低年轻人的价值，我们支持95后、00后整顿职场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1963">00:32:43</a> 亲子关系中的权力关系渗透生活，装修是家长权威的象征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">00:35:37</a> 母亲的伪善：她们把私欲包装成母爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2406">00:40:06</a> 痛苦的母亲不与父亲抗争，而总对孩子诉苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2572">00:42:52</a> 原谅也好，离开也好：两个女儿相拥而泣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">00:47:00</a> 能从女儿视角看待世界的母亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3121">00:52:01</a> 母爱不等同于母职</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">00:54:30</a> 希望母亲自私，也希望母亲坦诚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3488">00:58:08</a> 母亲的唠叨，是因为父亲的沉默</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">01:01:01</a> 不记得、不在乎、不喜爱女儿的父亲们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3904">01:05:04</a> 淡忘父亲身影的女儿们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">01:07:00</a> 父母定义的“合家欢”时光是子女的痛苦回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖提及书籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小团圆》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《女人味的昨天、今天和明天》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《光之领地》</span></p><span></span><p><span>“Regretting Motherhood”</span></p><span></span><p><span>《她们不是唠叨，只是受够了》</span></p><span></span><p><span>📺提及影视</span></p><span></span><p><span>《婚姻故事》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《都挺好》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我杀了我妈妈》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《东京物语》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《秋日奏鸣曲》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《晨光正好》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqCAu9-0FX_H1AexmZk-OdNJhMyz.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgLzj7rjDrwEmGRowS3F5pOGOjXY.m4a" length="141036566" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsycFHJiBVppldtZaDOIw92F7BvW.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>视觉时代的男女：彼此凝视，各服美役？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65708d4154f87fe00fbd81dd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65708d4154f87fe00fbd81dd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Dec 2023 15:03:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgw3rDc5Xu8XmVHnQrnsKFjWxlbT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a>“黑长直look”和“寸头女孩look”的刻板印象。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a> 辣妹装或男装，都会被骚扰。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 男性重视着装反而会被视为不够男性气质。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a> 对女性而言，被看是束缚，不被看也是痛苦。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 害怕被丈夫冷落的妻子们在生育后，急于寻求医美修复。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> 两性关系里对女性的评估集中在视觉方面。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 女性以“男性凝视”的模式在《封神》中消费男色。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 孟常认为男色经济的潮流尚未将服美役的压力传导给普通男性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 男性才应该是更有婚育焦虑的那一方。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> “好嫁风”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1129">18:49</a> 由男性掌握的影像媒介和娱乐产业对于普通人日常打扮的影响。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1314">21:54</a> 女性在普通职场和风俗业中工作特质的类同。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1466">24:26</a> Lisa疯马秀。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> 崔雪莉与纪录片《致真理》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖提及书籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>上野千鹤子、铃木凉美，《始于极限：女性主义往复书简》，新星出版社，2022年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>鈴木涼美、『「□□女優」の社会学』、青土社、2013年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>堀あきこ、『欲望のコード』、臨川書店、2009年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📺提及影视</span></p><span></span><p><span>《致真理》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《封神第一部：朝歌风云》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjfArsK2mR_1ljn5aXxrzKqX6Fhb.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvwLpkZcLr7nJnI_AXVLuoPe_ybR.m4a" length="63652997" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsycFHJiBVppldtZaDOIw92F7BvW.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
